  "description": "After running away from home due to an unforeseen incident, Cha-heon, who had been living alone, meets a boy by chance in the forest and names him Cha-yoon, adopting him as his son.\n\nAs time passes, Cha-yoon's feelings for his father\nevolve beyond paternal love into a dangerous obsession, and he finally reveals his suppressed desires when Cha-heon suggests marriage.\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/809044248), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000107969), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/donga93309)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1286012548), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000078268)",
